id=a2dp_sink_enabler
name=A2DP Sink/Source Switcher (OnePlus 9RT)
version=1.3.2
versionCode=6
author=ayankarmakar913
description=[OxygenOS 16 / MT2111 ONLY] Switch A2DP SOURCE (normal output; AAC/other codecs OK) <-> SINK (receiver; SBC forced; AAC sink crashes). WebUI: Toggle + SINK-only Restart/Fix-no-sound. APatch/Magisk. Use at your own risk.
